* ---- bridge_dhs_village.dta ----
use "bridge_dhs_village.dta", clear
label data "DHS village questionnaire"
note _dta: Missingness is heavy and uneven, which is why the twelve placebo regressions run on samples ranging from 398 to 1,449 observations. Zero of the 21 resulting estimates are significant at 5 percent.
note year: Integer period index, NOT a calendar year. Nightlights: 1=1992-94, 2=1995-97, 3=1998-2000, 4=2001-04, 5=2005-07, 6=2008-10, 7=2011-13. Census: 1=1991, 2=2001, 3=2011. Yield: 1=1988-91, 2=1992-94, 3=1995-97, 4=1998-2000, 5=2001-04, 6=2005-07, 7=2008-10, 8=2011-13. DHS: 1=1994, 2=1996, 3=1997, 4=2003, 5=2007, 6=2011, 7=2013.. Construction: Annual satellite and yield series are averaged into three-year blocks to smooth transitory shocks. The bridge opened in June 1998, inside nightlights period 3 and yield period 4.. Units: index. Source: Blankespoor et al. (2021) replication package
