note dist_district: Distance from the village to the district headquarters. Non-missing for 618 rows.. Construction: DHS village questionnaire, reported in miles.. Units: miles. Source: The DHS Program
note NGO: Whether an income-generating NGO operates in the village. Non-missing for only 413 rows, and the treatment terms are dropped for collinearity in the placebo regression.. Construction: DHS village questionnaire.. Units: 0/1. Source: The DHS Program
note dist_satellite_clinic: Distance to the nearest satellite health clinic. The sparsest variable in the file, non-missing for only 398 rows.. Construction: DHS village questionnaire.. Units: miles. Source: The DHS Program
note padma_m: Crow-fly distance from the unit centroid to the planned Padma bridge site.. Construction: Computed in ArcGIS from upazila-level shapefiles for Bangladesh.. Units: metres. Source: Blankespoor et al. (2021), from Bangladesh shapefiles
note jamuna_m: Crow-fly distance from the unit centroid to the Jamuna bridge foot.. Construction: Computed in ArcGIS from upazila-level shapefiles for Bangladesh.. Units: metres. Source: Blankespoor et al. (2021), from Bangladesh shapefiles
